---
import ExFrame from './ExFrame.astro';
import Tag from './Tag.astro';
import Lines from './Lines.astro';

// Booklet p.1.16 · Tool 3 The Break, Part B: the Blame Scale, filled example (the top half of the page).
interface Props {
  alt: string;
  caption: string;
}
const { alt, caption } = Astro.props;
---

<ExFrame page="1.16" alt={alt} caption={caption}>
  <div class="bs">
    <div class="top">
      <h4>Step 3 fails: the upload is rejected.</h4>
      <div class="badges">
        <Tag>S5 Blame tokens 1 · 2 · ★</Tag>
        <span class="pill">Example</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="scale">
      <p class="said"><Lines lines={['Meera: “PDF kaise banate hain, mujhe hi', 'nahi pata tha”']} /></p>
      <div class="rail">
        <span class="tok t1">1</span>
        <span class="tok t2">2</span>
        <span class="tok ts" aria-label="Star: where the blame belongs"><svg viewBox="-14.4 -14.4 28.8 28.8" aria-hidden="true"><circle r="12.45" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-dasharray="4.1 2.42" /></svg>★</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ends">
        <p><b>Self</b><br />“Mujhe hi nahi pata tha.”</p>
        <p class="r"><b>System</b><br />“Ye portal hi bekaar hai.”</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reads">
      <p class="c1"><b>1 · Where she puts it.</b> On herself.</p>
      <p class="c2">
        <b>2 · What the product implies.</b><br class="b" />{' '}
        <Lines lines={['“Please upload in the prescribed', 'format”: her fault.']} />
      </p>
      <p class="c3">
        <b>★ Where it belongs.</b>{' '}
        <Lines lines={['The', 'Requirements Map: no way to', 'make a PDF on a phone.']} />
      </p>
    </div>

    <p class="gap">
      The gap is the distance between what this product <b>punishes</b> and what it should have<br class="b" />{' '}<b>designed for</b>.
    </p>
  </div>
</ExFrame>

<style is:global>
  .bs {
    --bk-terra: #a8432a;
    --bk-amber-ink: #8a5e10;
    --bk-cream: #f5f0e6;
    background: #fff;
    border: calc(var(--u) * 0.75) solid var(--bk-ink);
    border-radius: calc(var(--u) * 16);
    padding: calc(var(--u) * 14) calc(var(--u) * 15.4) calc(var(--u) * 13.9);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .bs p {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .bs .top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: calc(var(--u) * 8);
  }
  .bs h4 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--t-lead);
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 15;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.4;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }
  .bs .badges {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: calc(var(--u) * 6);
  }
  .bs .pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    height: calc(var(--u) * 15.7);
    min-height: 1.9em;
    padding: 0 calc(var(--u) * 9);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--bk-ink);
    color: var(--bk-cream);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: max(11px, calc(var(--u) * 7.5));
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .bs .scale {
    margin-top: calc(var(--u) * 10);
  }
  .bs .said {
    margin-left: calc(var(--u) * 50);
    font-size: max(13px, calc(var(--u) * 9.4));
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 12.5;
    line-height: 1.28;
  }
  .bs .rail {
    position: relative;
    height: calc(var(--u) * 24);
    margin: calc(var(--u) * 8.8) calc(var(--u) * 7.2) 0;
  }
  .bs .rail::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    top: calc(50% - var(--u) * 1.5);
    height: calc(var(--u) * 3);
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #b14a30, var(--bk-terra) 12%, #1c1a17 88%);
  }
  .bs .tok {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    width: calc(var(--u) * 24);
    height: calc(var(--u) * 24);
    min-width: 24px;
    min-height: 24px;
    margin-left: max(-12px, calc(var(--u) * -12));
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    font-size: var(--t-body);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .bs .t1 {
    left: 12%;
    background: var(--bk-terra);
    color: #fff;
  }
  .bs .t2 {
    left: 26.95%;
    background: #e3a72f;
    color: var(--bk-ink);
  }
  .bs .ts {
    left: 86.2%;
    top: calc(var(--u) * 1.5);
    width: calc(var(--u) * 28.8);
    height: calc(var(--u) * 28.8);
    min-width: 28px;
    min-height: 28px;
    margin-left: max(-14px, calc(var(--u) * -14.4));
    margin-top: max(-2px, calc(var(--u) * -3));
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--bk-ink);
    font-weight: 400;
    position: absolute;
  }
  .bs .ts svg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }
  .bs .ends {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: calc(var(--u) * 12);
    margin: calc(var(--u) * 3.9) calc(var(--u) * 7.4) 0;
    font-size: max(13px, calc(var(--u) * 9.8));
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 13;
    line-height: 1.43;
  }
  .bs .ends .r {
    text-align: right;
  }

  .bs .reads {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, calc(var(--u) * 162.4));
    margin-top: calc(var(--u) * 11.5);
    font-size: max(13px, calc(var(--u) * 10.1));
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 13.5;
    line-height: 1.34;
  }
  .bs .reads b {
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .bs .reads .c1 b {
    color: var(--bk-terra);
  }
  .bs .reads .c2 b {
    color: var(--bk-amber-ink);
  }
  .bs .gap {
    margin-top: calc(var(--u) * 12.5);
    background: #f6e5be;
    border-radius: calc(var(--u) * 10);
    padding: calc(var(--u) * 9) calc(var(--u) * 10.4) calc(var(--u) * 10);
    font-size: var(--t-lead);
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 15;
    line-height: 1.41;
  }
  .bs .gap b {
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  @container (max-width: 45rem) {
    .bs,
    .bs .reads {
      white-space: normal;
    }
    .bs {
      border-radius: var(--r-md);
      padding: var(--sp-2);
    }
    .bs .top {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .bs .said {
      margin-left: 0;
    }
    .bs .rail {
      margin-inline: 14px;
    }
    .bs .ends {
      margin: 20px 0 0;
    }
    .bs .reads {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--sp-2);
      margin-top: var(--sp-3);
    }
    .bs .gap {
      margin-top: var(--sp-3);
      padding: var(--sp-2);
    }
  }
</style>
